  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 83cd6b8211edbb34e830a40f09d7582f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Letter from Supervisor
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  journalText: "Dear Clara, \r\n\r\nI hope this letter finds you. It's been a while
    since I last wrote to you. I\u2019m sorry.\r\n\r\nYou know that I have lived
    in Hephastoria since the early days and I loved to help build this city under
    the leadership of Josefine Cartwright. Such a wonderful woman. She was intelligent,
    a visionary, and had a good heart. She turned the dreams of her genius husband
    Francis into reality and honored his legacy. \r\n\r\nBut since her son Frederic
    took over the City, society just keeps falling apart more and more each day.
    This city once was such a great place. It didn\u2019t matter if you were poor
    or rich. \r\n\r\nFrederic couldn\u2019t care less about us hardworking people.
    Clara, the people are dying down in the slums, while the rich snobs up top gild
    their asses.\r\n\r\nThings have to change. Me and some fellow workers from the
    CORE decided to help THE UNSEEN, a group of rebels planning to overthrow Frederic
    and his bloody regime. They want to take over the CORE and the T.E.A.R.S. during
    Francis-memorial-day tomorrow evening.\r\n\r\nI will fight side by side with
    them for a better Hephastoria and in case we don\u2019t see each other again,
    I love you Clara! Take care of yourself and please don't come looking for me.\r\n\r\nLove,
    Derrick  "
  textAudio: {fileID: 0}
